target_verses.display_text:
And they will certainly do no harm,
nor will they be able at all to destroy anyone upon My holy mountain;
for the whole earth has been filled with the knowledge of the Lord,
as abundant water covers the seas.

The Lord is in His holy temple;
the Lord’s throne is in heaven.
His eyes look toward the needy;
His eyelids examine the sons of men.

Thine all-powerful word leaped from heaven, from royal thrones,
a stern warrior, into the midst of the doomed land,
carrying Thine unfeigned command as a sharp sword;

The waters saw Thee, God;
the waters saw Thee and feared,
and the depths were troubled—a multitude of sounding waters.

Thy thunder’s voice was in the wheel;
Thy flashes of lightning shone upon the inhabited world;
the earth shook and became trembling.

